       3.0e-01                7.5202e-01         0.4240  1.774e+00
       1.0e-01                1.2918e+00         0.4240  3.047e+00
       3.0e-02                2.3517e+00         0.4240  5.547e+00
       1.0e-02                4.0698e+00         0.4240  9.599e+00
