           1.0e+00     0.26641999   1.742668e-01  -1.692470e-01     1.742668e-01          YES
           1.0e+01     0.48750267   2.003186e-03  -5.024372e-04     2.003186e-04          YES
           1.0e+02     0.49976008   4.298392e-06  -1.189533e-07     4.298392e-08          YES
